# Title: Potential PSFactoryBuffer COM Hijacking
# ID: 243380fa-11eb-4141-af92-e14925e77c1b
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: BlackBerry Threat Research and Intelligence Team - @Joseliyo_Jstnk
